    {
      "id": "99c707f1a05f0153c1c5d376cea163411baaadee6994ccdf053d35813000beea",
      "text": "Here's How To Stream Claude Code With AFK Ralph",
      "hash": "13d20351103a1be931bc9a4d65e749799cfdc30f585bd3c2052c112ccc4e2095"
    },
    {
      "id": "543afc564ff08805bf7cb9ebe13d9f49ac65addcc17fe8f2c46e12403ee01fda",
      "text": "Stream Claude code in real-time while running AFK Ralph. Learn how to use jq to get visibility into Claude's output instead of staring at a blank screen.",
      "hash": "9b8c23f86f492b4555da0f3a080a576cfaebd465f033ba8468195fdda0537244"
    },
    {
      "id": "59954f3d080005a36c4f79915ab41c47d9b6f37bfc2b0adee136f42cb24fdaf8",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "66c2ec11ffda8af4d9d2e32a81e0c3f8e2341d22d810cca4722e89ef9c73fece",
      "text": "Subscribe",
      "hash": "cc0e38da9c41790bffef1b88af32d39ac285edce93da766810edc237cb2f1625"
    },
    {
      "id": "ccfde7e2b73f6e0b10d22100f412b3c7d606f5a9739d90c5709bf6fbca49764a",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "7fc1cbf92e71cef04ac5bcf82fe64cecd0f74b3080ae30ffb6853300ff92c32d",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "a87673b143aea570f44fffcbbacd45ccab4ae052b288e1797acafb6674dce97d",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b29e1107858eebb2fd3e39f6db4f4ad7917aafa1e69343ae1f4734cd4db756d",
      "text": "The Problem: A Blank Screen",
      "hash": "ed4c3a665c287b6332e2abb24dbf459191387eface9f1bd71e164242e0d6f869"
    },
    {
      "id": "6da686aa1efa281446baef6bc4426ca106652ed6b8d58fbd734d0932710c2a55",
      "text": "The Solution: Streaming with jq",
      "hash": "40df4eceb2f1ac18fb316bccfb134a9a1d6f2a2cdfdeca3e380650381c936df6"
    },
    {
      "id": "d9523e2a6a2614abe1b1a21690591869aff9c33d3d409411c4f56493e154571e",
      "text": "Walking Through the Script Structure",
      "hash": "de041491e1b493744f3c6fc849e723ddda29a9237278b4eebb22b7b1d39d4ca4"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4505a93d39c728dcd025fe6dd3ccc550f06dbc17cbfd558839bff1995eaf572",
      "text": "Conclusion",
      "hash": "89db2ad881f29c18b305a20c8ed7bdffdfde49d633c27a83bd204bf9cfedaba3"
    },
    {
      "id": "d9a6b88872801d5225d1f07be1db99a2d329437fee7facc35170a9832397ce04",
      "text": "Related reading",
      "hash": "89c21c36ad5ffbab7b05ced367c46013c8d7b8ddf53a8b9739b7b2545f78abee"
    },
    {
      "id": "2802db62c1bcff2c1834de972ff1ef79a4c5de8a7d5eeb57be363245bfbab3db",
      "text": "This guide is for people who've tried Ralph with Claude Code and hit that frustration point: running the",
      "hash": "37851706f7968adec3ba5c596a6171f61c933ea620a713bdad7841b93e44e87c"
    },
    {
      "id": "1f03dc1a5b7dfc09420d2470aca72e8f1d3f6e1d64e4e4686ed2a6c1c5b4a04a",
      "text": "AFK",
      "hash": "875e0577157f743e3346ba95f1d944d08e54b3cab40d89819dff5f48cd507392"
    },
    {
      "id": "b9a5a838b5d73575920cbce81388b8afc50b196f74d742d61a9451b77cee9020",
      "text": "script and ending up staring at a blank screen.",
      "hash": "39c5d33ab2e2ed176fad0a26bb1603efa8683026174b4f98446518c1cd129f13"
    },
    {
      "id": "0745d8115c603ab992406e628740874d1c21dc9bc0f6da044cbee3d35c4b4017",
      "text": "If you've never heard of Ralph, start here:",
      "hash": "4d7008d275032a1d9527a3bee936234ac641547d0c72e9ec2df35a1d1cb414b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "fe7c15690c2096b5da1f817c687fcfdcfac0556321d4075dc70a0f9d9f3b5197",
      "text": "Getting Started With Ralph",
      "hash": "0c1a87746b851c00c3ffd0dec2215d9d86fa88a08fd56f3f517533b314680124"
    },
    {
      "id": "6321fa500b8596d48095e65495c47fca4cc5bbbd3453201c92921f9f7ae9fee3",
      "text": "11 Tips For AI Coding With Ralph",
      "hash": "f4652d85c092d213a11d5e92ce3b4d3380faca1f846849fc7ce179cd05c44cdc"
    },
    {
      "id": "00735979929ba0cb7bafcc4ea1065f8e8ac11c36592eb5469b38353dca8d852f",
      "text": "When you want Ralph to run while you're away from your keyboard, you might use a script like this:",
      "hash": "da234a81318ac2f13cc44594764f0ac1af072e4926662d9c436d7cdf3f067160"
    },
    {
      "id": "347017ca4d1c37c3def3a74f5484d94a4e8d80eb68005c188c15e62993feecfd",
      "text": "The issue here is frustrating: when you run Claude with the",
      "hash": "2a7bf149c355e42c09a2489babdfbeb8fc41b85148294b817438d8bfa124637d"
    },
    {
      "id": "33ae9a55cacbdc890d966a620eeb0d24a7fe07a3b574f05843d84238ded395ac",
      "text": "flag, you get zero streaming output. Your terminal goes blank.",
      "hash": "a8e39c2276e1fbbb1cca02a5f04da954b2eae8a0dd07f7ba0957c29b69952e78"
    },
    {
      "id": "535cb474f3b960d7b287cb0855b280773977bf725565568e53e22c4a11ca0c02",
      "text": "You walk away, and you have absolutely no idea what's happening. Is Claude working? Is it stuck? Did something break? You won't know until it's finished.",
      "hash": "16a5fe53bb71c04cd67c109f3cb950587f86fd9c5371a49530505395b7080b45"
    },
    {
      "id": "add8c905fdd910f18ef2da3e304c193a2a246eb52d79c60333e42139ac8707e0",
      "text": "The dream with AFK Ralph is to get the best of both worlds: you want real-time visibility into what Claude is doing, but you also want to leave it running while you step away.",
      "hash": "70be2ecb252445768f17264a2ec205e42af1c0d425587970d4116397bd352570"
    },
    {
      "id": "19a0aa6cd378d4dd83d02b8c18b16d90823461ab46dd15e2742fb9dfcb2828c6",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "7dbd5c9e1b5de1774909e42de6fd1b03b716bd8de249cc9362f3801048429769",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "b660c0f64705816f17ccc1f8ab85f02c9fec4b521f1f6446a372c43140966dbe",
      "text": "Claude can output",
      "hash": "83db589eba5cb4343fb0b3ec9ff71248f17c3a7feab2def39ff6b20ce868e4ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "115efb6d31eff64d5fddf4278329fce01aae4b87659f5c8ee5d73c7375dedfab",
      "text": "format, which gives you every single message as it happens. But that output is extremely verbose and unreadable.",
      "hash": "d2a8257f7853e517fce71c3a1b9f98cf2e8aad8e0910179f9a8ce12fc8952c86"
    },
    {
      "id": "efb525c7fd86b9450ec65c6f961992888975876c4ab90a416525bad17b7b63cf",
      "text": "By combining",
      "hash": "02f4bcc4b2d22bbcc633b8037239ccf60d77cc2c832f4e6fd2f38ce6a4eba123"
    },
    {
      "id": "20856eb91f82eab6e485a51f5f63b794d33f74ec8b4df986ddaf7f347403a3a1",
      "text": "filtering, you can extract just the useful information and stream it to your terminal in real-time. At the same time, you capture the final result to check for the",
      "hash": "140af7b45994820ad40be019df3dcc5f56585384f547dec4b088a759a1ac2741"
    },
    {
      "id": "dbdce310fc886135adf752bdaa0745d3e7ae4e3513e00bd7ae56d897da2de1df",
      "text": "marker.",
      "hash": "f2d65cf40126b2a502548fa727629557c6bebfc3dde45fe52b7ada4b7867b15c"
    },
    {
      "id": "a0ee67df6bb0d50ba904b3a4a16086c165a0c1be9490b309e002a29bce8b02cd",
      "text": "Here's the complete script:",
      "hash": "08b977aabf998326bdcb1953fd3568469a111b1ad2f9745ad032193398ef9061"
    },
    {
      "id": "13a07360f16be4d8002e9c0b221b0f2052102019ebf7635f673780e750dfdd15",
      "text": "This script accepts one argument: the number of iterations to run.",
      "hash": "25a196e1e41013e8922b5c82aaf5a65732a30bdaf2699fba017ab6a0ee2cb79b"
    },
    {
      "id": "895a66c20f0b63a31ab9a3ee15bfacc7b11e64a060f40c83e2de96ad6e23f473",
      "text": "Breaking Down the Stream Filter",
      "hash": "a9d3c9bf779527b213ced75c73a211fde941ad00bc869b80e267003b11e8185d"
    },
    {
      "id": "8bc753cb4b7a2ab6b27a7f40844952ad9190ae88cdbf53ffa5b4f346598111ea",
      "text": "The stream filter does several important things:",
      "hash": "20692c57895d8d5c216b3a349f4bd0fde528aea4bb17180566f5315b85bab34b"
    },
    {
      "id": "ab242c20ad2e94f7742cb5fc5ffc5e693419ae2c76017d1e4ec18295b6d3e826",
      "text": "Selects assistant messages",
      "hash": "e1763c886d90f08c3f7fd6d14e5d8c2c55dc8d05748fac1b8537dec4743d5f24"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbac1b7f56cabd0a791a98baada1001c32ab5d4022cd0428abcfae4db56cf8d0",
      "text": "grabs only Claude's responses",
      "hash": "c0129c0d1d47275015270133ebe1a3844b5a9eed3c4aaaa278b6bf3be1e153d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f48d95d1246bd79ae3bb1643636549e4a7612409934ccdcca2acbb21d7ec56b",
      "text": "Extracts text content",
      "hash": "e5d42b6db5e6b6a0ebe653fb7fc1e3349cd705f47cbd64547384f9a1e4f40ce0"
    },
    {
      "id": "08cb81cc8d6a8fd9676e55cd6c8330052bac9bece390d49b3a13ee12fb7ae660",
      "text": "pulls out just the text portions",
      "hash": "c623aaa2056a241266d1e5f40a4d2b807887c491a3a3da5727b87b9452818c33"
    },
    {
      "id": "b016dd95345d174742e22d09f3e3d7ab8e248147a3a316bcde2445264732a5f3",
      "text": "Fixes line endings",
      "hash": "0a990e2d91c39ead829173fe8003d6361a59ffb613996437e88b9599ea8d3acc"
    },
    {
      "id": "ed7dbfb46cff3a91187c1bc970c01e1cfc0177029586347ea31591da4270c3ad",
      "text": "replaces newlines with carriage return + newline",
      "hash": "a9bd66449d87dace6d6293ed316829d7003f54dca4a8f13232d72aee69d35aa9"
    },
    {
      "id": "f577ab56f9cca80039a875a29939d3ac6658fe482737b7dbb9181b08c8294f7b",
      "text": "Adds spacing",
      "hash": "c4532faadff165972dee5f38c86c634855d679143391b215c7c2ab96f4ceb020"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0f9c7530f134c8cdc58d2be2f70983133526e90ce64a7413a610ec27b043f4f",
      "text": "inserts extra space between messages",
      "hash": "33b7842f720324d2ede95377dc037cf4ee2ebd298e008ac809e70c69ee820ae1"
    },
    {
      "id": "badcb1ce65923f6b33d5756bee4ba6a3e54a0289a7335f3db021aa48ed72312c",
      "text": "The carriage return replacement fixes a bug where the cursor wasn't returning to the first character of the line properly.",
      "hash": "a516158b89ae991844ce5a755d843edb21bcc2f0090968b02b4cd679e134e543"
    },
    {
      "id": "a78407a6ac014b4a94a2608c7134d6fc9eff39e6181be63ae24ee32336cc4b11",
      "text": "The Data Pipeline",
      "hash": "6f6757b6b27a4ad3bc3fda323c5b9e6cceb3c1840ba91ab0bb7f58f9ad047099"
    },
    {
      "id": "74943f5dc8a7d677d2532ee2cedcf9c72c835207fcc5fbb79a4936e27ad84a82",
      "text": "Here's how data flows through the script:",
      "hash": "595dc79dab6de5e67aa6e98f9dfd4011477d6c85bfddf0289915893c2dc3ed41"
    },
    {
      "id": "e47ece18168530f520baa5fbc61760f1f13796ba7d5b99642e6c5300de620315",
      "text": "Docker streams out",
      "hash": "06b825d19c0cfd8216b4edcd23170cb5fa585f7a32472de33d886aad4a93b352"
    },
    {
      "id": "e1f7f132a93debdc0aa1ee10869c7684a3c3bebde9e21b47bb1d5ea61715836e",
      "text": "formatted data, but it includes some non-JSON lines just for noise. The",
      "hash": "00e9437dbdec402059458265efe94c0ac2491d5adfec5f561700ce433fe359e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "0173c79ee49818bca65c0fc13e97e503e930d7beb8c17a44493da67c2d7120d9",
      "text": "filter ensures only valid JSON lines get processed.",
      "hash": "507645d01d88778febba85931a6ef840211c15bd286896239a16713ca82b6172"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7ea63e926a6b85627e132554b65504d5d1502150b5575260869b4ebf1e17d8d",
      "text": "The",
      "hash": "b344d80e24a3679999fa964450b34bc24d1578a35509f934c1418b0a20d21a67"
    },
    {
      "id": "c38a469fdc0fd62ed5cfb23bc97796f54af4c9547bdf55abe07bd4a776aa858c",
      "text": "command writes everything to a temporary file without stopping the stream. You need this file later to check if Claude has finished.",
      "hash": "c26c08956d270e03e48e24925d7a486f2d5e4c109d33deb00f613b853bda204d"
    },
    {
      "id": "29308b254d7c4c70f766575a9459c05af0baddf478f6c1fe046d5e7aba0af1d7",
      "text": "Finally,",
      "hash": "39396ed2bd000ba1e2bf0bcaaac49216ef329f9de4bc28807ff04b5721bf805f"
    },
    {
      "id": "86fe1217dd284165bbe1d099fb31e10ca6c0ae41ac6a0923d593d1e802320646",
      "text": "applies the streaming filter and displays the text in real-time to your terminal.",
      "hash": "b3bf2ec71f038474695fa63165a781a09034e4441e999a84118e27e077c6c454"
    },
    {
      "id": "b061599d7a7da874d8aad2626ba41ee5807b9b9d65d0091f6e4ee1faba822c3b",
      "text": "My hope is that relatively soon I'll be able to delete this article because Claude Code will have shipped a feature that allows you to stream the responses while still capturing the final output.",
      "hash": "19ce23626b833dd7480d68f7cc3b6dd1c333ea669684d2fdfe7b0f608aff3732"
    },
    {
